re [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-104458" :question/id #uuid "fcd56ce7-673a-5e4c-a842-541a666d3fe8" :question/math-academy-id "q-104458" :question/problem "The cubic polynomial $P(x)$ has roots ${x}_{1}=-3,$ ${x}_{2}=-2,$ and ${x}_{3}=3,$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $4.$ Find $P(x).$" :question/worked-solution "Since our cubic polynomial has roots ${x}_{1}=-3,$ ${x}_{1}=-2,$ and ${x}_{3}=3,$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $a=4,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(x-{x}_{1})(x-{x}_{2})(x-{x}_{3}) & =4(x-(-3))(x-(-2))(x-3) \\\\  & =4(x+3)(x+2)(x-3)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4(x+3)(x+2)(x-3) & =4({x}^{2}+5x+6)(x-3) \\\\  & =4({x}^{3}-3{x}^{2}+5{x}^{2}-15x+6x-18) \\\\  & =4({x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}-9x-18) \\\\  & =4{x}^{3}+8{x}^{2}-36x-72.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(x)=4{x}^{3}+8{x}^{2}-36x-72.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-104458/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "517f2054-008e-54eb-89dd-5f0a09e1f881"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-104458"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-316619/field-1/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "38e9bc78-4057-531d-8c84-04ac59c4b9ba" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316619/field-1/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "8b7b79a8-bd7d-5421-861f-a35d03d95d6a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316619/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "3a2afe4d-ae4d-56b7-9a8e-785946d6dc98" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-316619/field-1/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer-field/choices ["q-316619/field-1/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc362