fbaf59570d63e930fc5c94f26cb6f5091dc"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-316619" :question/id #uuid "590f3038-6cc4-5c97-85c0-ebec225d6230" :question/math-academy-id "q-316619" :question/problem "The cubic polynomial $P(x)$ has roots ${x}_{1}=1,$ ${x}_{2}=-3,$ and ${x}_{3}=4,$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $5.$ Find $P(x).$\n\n$P(x)=$\n{{field-1}}${x}^{3}\\,-$\n{{field-2}}${x}^{2}\\,-$\n{{field-3}}$x\\,+$\n{{field-4}}" :question/worked-solution "Since our cubic polynomial has roots ${x}_{1}=1,$ ${x}_{2}=-3,$ and ${x}_{3}=4,$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $a=5,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(x-{x}_{1})(x-{x}_{2})(x-{x}_{3}) & =5(x-1)(x-(-3))(x-4) \\\\  & =5(x-1)(x+3)(x-4)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5(x-1)(x+3)(x-4) & =5({x}^{2}+2x-3)(x-4) \\\\  & =5({x}^{3}-4{x}^{2}+2{x}^{2}-8x-3x+12) \\\\  & =5({x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}-11x+12) \\\\  & =5{x}^{3}-10{x}^{2}-55x+60.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(x)=5{x}^{3}-10{x}^{2}-55x+60.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-316619/field-1" "q-316619/field-2" "q-316619/field-3" "q-316619/field-4"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "517f2054-008e-54eb-89dd-5f0a09e1f881"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-316619"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-316621/field-1/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "e4c645a7-6e88-5972-b95f-905dac795ff5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316621/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "91791d0a-1066-5c42-b09c-9cb09d183694" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-316621/field-1/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer-field/choices ["q-316621/field-1/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b"] :db